sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob
    participant C as Carol
    A->>+B: start
    alt everything is fine
        B->>C: ask
        Note right of C: a fairly long note on the right side
    else something failed badly
        B-->>A: error
        Note left of A: left note in else
    else third branch
        B->>B: retry once more
    end
    B-->>-A: done
    loop every 30 seconds
        opt only when idle
            Note left of A: nested left note
            A->>A: think hard about it
        end
        par fan out
            A->>B: one
        and second branch label
            A->>C: two
        end
    end
    loop last
        C->>C: a self-message label beside the last lifeline
    end
